        "sha256": "6c480b6af6ba893a040e2e14c32754c71577676e2e240546cb155c471b89e093"
      },
      "title": "HMM-centered workflow"
    },
    {
      "caption": "OrthoBench precision/recall and Three Kingdoms pair F1 use different reference scopes. These descriptive comparisons do not form a cross-benchmark ranking; Three Kingdoms is supplementary conserved-family evidence.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_current_accuracy_overview_20261002_v2/current_accuracy_overview.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 2,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 23460,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_current_accuracy_overview_20261002_v2/current_accuracy_overview.pdf",
        "sha256": "00d9e627c1c1a2ddb9f34164df30a71cebc2ff62c0be1651e88c6c719d4bfea8"
      },
      "title": "Current eight-method accuracy overview"
    },
    {
      "caption": "GO and EC are similarity scores; VGNC, SwissTrees and TreeFam-A are F1 endpoints, and FAS measures feature-architecture similarity. Eligibility and denominators differ; this plot is descriptive, not paired uncertainty.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_corrected_qfo_endpoints_20260926/corrected_qfo_endpoints.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 3,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 22853,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_corrected_qfo_endpoints_20260926/corrected_qfo_endpoints.pdf",
        "sha256": "b75cc43adf8446ebcc41ff96c89fc29afcfd34f05da7704c79140282f23e216f"
      },
      "title": "Individual corrected QfO endpoints"
    },
    {
      "caption": "All 21 method-metric contrasts retain their multiplicity-adjusted RefOG intervals for F1, precision and recall. Development exposure and family-exchangeability assumptions limit inference. An interval containing zero establishes neither superiority nor equivalence.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_ob_complete_uncertainty_20260928/ob_complete_uncertainty.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 4,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 25300,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_ob_complete_uncertainty_20260928/ob_complete_uncertainty.pdf",
        "sha256": "58d7fce23f2773fd43f25ae233b541d98668ee8ea68c24056f6381b1c140b778"
      },
      "title": "OrthoBench paired differences"
    },
    {
      "caption": "The corrected SwissTrees factorial retains all cells and component contrasts. Candidate expansion interacts with reconciliation; profile-refinement F1 intervals include zero. These conditional effects do not establish universal improvement.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/qfo_corrected_factorial_figures_20260919/qfo_factorial_swiss.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 5,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 33149,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/qfo_corrected_factorial_figures_20260919/qfo_factorial_swiss.pdf",
        "sha256": "6a96d0be739725e8ffef78b0a489c19c45a5f99b3bdba4d517bf4e84a6eb7e6d"
      },
      "title": "HMM, expansion and reconciliation factorial"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Shared-denominator and exclusive-pair terms reproduce the aggregate differences for all seven comparators against full OrthoFinder. This is arithmetic decomposition of eligible scored sets, not proteome-wide coverage, causal attribution or confidence intervals.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_qfo_scored_pair_decomposition_20260930/qfo_pair_decomposition.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 6,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 19640,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_qfo_scored_pair_decomposition_20260930/qfo_pair_decomposition.pdf",
        "sha256": "eb122dcc785bd54df0c0d81b9f0323b839ac193533069d65b6cf672b399d9721"
      },
      "title": "GO and EC scored-pair composition"
    },
    {
      "caption": "The fixed-graph diagnostic compares HMM-derived search evidence with DIAMOND on 35 simulation datasets. It is development-exposed, without profile expansion or phylogeny, and does not match computational effort or compare full OrthoFinder.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/matched_graph_figure_v2_20260926/matched_graph.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 7,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 26260,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/matched_graph_figure_v2_20260926/matched_graph.pdf",
        "sha256": "c7f618833e6d68bcac2594abae4e8af1cc099d802cd26f75188941c707b8d953"
      },
      "title": "Matched-recall HMM search control"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Ninety endpoints arise from 90,000 independent sequence pairs and 180,000 dependent full/banded evaluations. Composition and length change approximate tail behavior. This is not calibrated orthology confidence, a biological false-positive rate or fitted parameters.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_frozen_null_scores_20261002_v2/frozen_null_scores.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 8,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 30735,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_frozen_null_scores_20261002_v2/frozen_null_scores.pdf",
        "sha256": "1ddd5fde7fd2855ad7f79e7f230a1c660e9b0fbe0a431e6bbb270eddf8131b01"
      },
      "title": "Synthetic null-score tails"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Native failures remain in the fixed-length panel. No OrthoFinder output passes the stated native-completion/finite-graph gate, so its 14 planned comparisons are unavailable rather than OrthoHMM wins.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_simulation_fixed_native_20260916/simulation_evidence.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 9,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 20596,
