        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/qfo_parameter_complete_export_20261001/qfo_parameter_neighborhood.pdf",
        "sha256": "b395ec4285f59b69c55888d5db73008e93a44deb9f5614b75bf6e3807d23c563"
      },
      "title": "Complete local parameter neighborhood"
    },
    {
      "caption": "The frozen separate-clade test supplies bounded transfer evidence. Its subsequent overlap partition is descriptive, preserves false-positive allocations and does not establish family-disjoint confirmation or a second independent test.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_ygob_overlap_20260928/ygob_overlap_strata.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 13,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 32182,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_ygob_overlap_20260928/ygob_overlap_strata.pdf",
        "sha256": "446a33dc00f198859a236c9c55b37493f60a3a3281eddd9cdac8c1a839ba2df3"
      },
      "title": "YGOB transfer and overlap strata"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Anchor separation is distinguished from supported separation and reference-homolog coverage. Coverage can be high for merged anchors and is not orthology recall. Prespecified losses and negative OrthoHMM comparisons are retained.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/figures_wgd_application_20260917/wgd_application.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 14,
      "pdf": {
        "bytes": 26130,
        "path": "benchmark_tools/results/figures_wgd_application_20260917/wgd_application.pdf",
        "sha256": "0c1439735b8af157c481ccc3b31d31f4f9acb218f040803b0e888324aaec8c93"
      },
      "title": "Whole-genome-duplicate biological application"
    },
    {
      "caption": "Fourteen frozen descriptive strata retain all eight methods, precision/recall/F1 and empty bins. Development exposure and small bins limit interpretation. Length, copy number and composition are descriptors, not validated fragments, duplication histories or causal error mechanisms.",
      "link_aliases": [
        "/mnt/ca1e2e99-718e-417c-9ba6-62421455971a/ORTHOHMM/orthohmm/benchmark_tools/results/ob_complete_strata_figure_20260928/ob_complete_strata.pdf"
      ],
      "number": 15,
