        "sha256": "e8141adb34b6a8a4ffa14fde666e5194d084e161489943377228d6315e873a95"
      },
      "title": "All-method OrthoBench error strata"
    },
    {
      "caption": "All 27 attempts are reviewed: 25 measured, 24 eligible; six cells have three eligible repeats. Three cells lack a third eligible repeat and remain unavailable. Matched CPU/RAM limits do not remove unknown, potentially tool-dependent contention; no isolated efficiency ranking follows.",
      "link_aliases": [
